    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d299">

                <pb facs="0483" n="373" xml:id="pg373"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">881.00/1408: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Frame</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Herrick</hi>) <hi
                        rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of
                    State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Paris</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1928-05-25T20:00:00+01:00"><hi rendition="#italic">May 25, 1928—8
                                p.m.</hi></date><lb/>[Received 8:35 p.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>134. My 95, April 14, 1 p.m.<anchor n="24" xml:id="d299-f1"/> Associated Press
                    corroborates reported Tangier agreement reached yesterday. In addition Foreign
                    Office informs me that when eventually signed it will be communicated to all
                    signatories to Act of Algeciras.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Herrick</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
